WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.950
Hey Yui, did he call you by your first name?

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:08.360
How did it feel?

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:13.190
Well, it's like I just heard my name for the first time.

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:16.860
I fell in love with my name!

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.900
How nice, Yui.

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:26.350
Huh? What is this sad feeling?

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:30.700
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:35.160
Don't tell me I'm feeling a bit..

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:37.600
Hanabi...

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.730
I can't believe it.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:44.950
No, uh, I...

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:48.250
You have a leaf on your head.

00:00:48.990 --> 00:00:51.820
You took a shortcut since you were running late, right?

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:54.600
I'm sorry.

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:56.980
Yui you worry about others too much.

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:59.300
I can't help it...

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:02.020
Was I a bother?

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:06.740
No! I love that part about you!

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:57.310
Yes, that's correct.

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:59.660
Great job on studying.

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:07.750
My friend Yui is more like an older sister than a 12-year-old girl.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.770
You're amazing, Yui.

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:13.150
Next question, Ayase.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.840
Do you know how to solve this question?

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:18.830
Uh... Uh...

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:20.800
Ayase, your book is upside down.

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:23.560
Pay attention, Ayase!

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:25.870
So different from Aoi!

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:29.000
I'm so embarrassed!

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:34.880
Everyone was laughing at me...

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:36.820
Don't worry about it.

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:40.690
Let's figure out the problem together before the next math class.

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:43.110
Takao!

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.670
Let's study together.

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:45.960
Yui!

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:48.310
You two are so kind!

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:50.790
Okay! I'll do my best!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:58.610
A kiss in the classroom!

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:02.690
No! We were just picking up my pencil!

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:04.700
What a couple!

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:07.590
So hot and heavy in the morning!

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:10.310
You guys are wrong, I said!

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.870
So lewd! Quite lewd!

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:13.400
Stop it!

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:14.460
Yui!

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.160
That's enough!

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:21.630
Next class is Music. Let's go to the music classroom before the teacher gets mad.

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:25.780
Yeah, yeah! Aoi is so scary!

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.780
Thanks, Yui!

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:29.620
Jeez.

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:36.960
Why do Eikou and his friends make fun of me so much?

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.340
They're guys, that's why.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:44.210
And couples are rare here, too. Can't be helped.

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:48.180
But Yui is in a couple too. They don't make fun of them.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:53.180
That's because she doesn't react like you, so they don't think it's worth it.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:56.850
That's what's going on?

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:59.300
Yui is so mature.

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:02.230
I see.

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:05.050
Aoi, can you come over here for a second?

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:05.900
Okay!

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:10.790
Yui is getting the attention of the teachers, too.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:13.410
She's really amazing.

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:31.840
I want to be just like Yui!

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:41.730
I stepped on the cat...

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:46.020
Stomped on the cat...

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:48.910
I guess the cat got stepped on.

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:53.290
Well, you can play that part like this.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:06:00.940
Hey Yui, why did you stop going to piano class?

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:05.300
You're so good. It's a shame.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:10.800
Well, I'm going to middle school soon, so I have to study more.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:14.480
Oh? You started going to cram school?

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:17.130
You've started getting ready for middle school already?

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:18.110
Y-Yeah.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:24.810
You're so bright, Yui!

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:26.920
Compared to you, I'm...

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:30.080
Mom! Give me some ice cream!

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:35.960
Are you taking the Middle School Exams?

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:41.570
You were talking about that with the teachers, right?

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:44.190
I was recommended to take them, too.

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:45.930
Middle School Exams?

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:49.460
Well, it has nothing to do with you, Hanabi.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.450
Let's go home together today.

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:08.640
Okay!

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:15.270
I didn't want to go by myself today, so thanks for inviting me.

00:07:15.270 --> 00:07:16.320
I see.

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:19.180
Yui has cram school today.

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:21.320
You seem down.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:23.870
Really?

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:26.110
Yes. Did something happen?

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:29.510
Nothing really.

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:31.690
It's just that Yui is amazing.

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:32.540
Aoi?

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:37.060
She's good at studying and everyone relies on her.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:39.990
I think she's just so amazing.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:47.230
I have this weird feeling when I see Yui.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:49.170
Right around here.

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:52.970
I don't know what I'm saying.

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:57.190
So you're a bit jealous of Aoi?

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:59.330
Jealous?

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:02.560
But that doesn't paint you in a good light.

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:03.850
Am I right?

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:06.100
Yes! That's right!

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:09.020
How did you know? You're a genius!

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:11.270
You're really easy to understand.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:16.710
Yui has started preparing for middle school already.

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:21.190
But I haven't thought about the future at all.

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:27.650
Why would Yui be friends with someone as childish as me?

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:31.840
You don't have to think about that.

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:34.110
Huh? But...

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:35.920
Ayase!

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:37.820
Are you okay?

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:41.460
It hurts!

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:48.730
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:51.520
It'll need a week to heal.

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:54.820
I'm sorry. I was there, too.

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:57.680
Did you do some intense exercise?

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.910
No, I just sprained it.

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:07.640
I can't say that I sprained it in front of my boyfriend while trying to act like a boy.

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:10.050
Don't lie, Ayase!

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:13.860
A sprain is just an excuse!

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:16.000
It's probably your period again! Your period!

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:19.160
Period! Period!

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:20.050
No!

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:22.500
Stop it already!

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.600
Period! Period! Period!

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:27.190
S-Stop it.
Period! Period! Period!

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:28.310
Period! Period! Period!

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:29.530
That's wrong!

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:30.890
Yui!

00:09:30.890 --> 00:09:35.310
Hanabi hasn't gotten her period yet!

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:44.660
Y-Yui...

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:55.030
I want to die.

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:59.080
I'm sorry, Hanabi!

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:01.090
I'm really sorry!

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:06.730
You didn't have to say it in front of Takao!

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:09.550
I didn't want them to misunderstand, so I...

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:14.350
I didn't ask you to do that!

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:16.900
Mind your own business, Yui.

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:25.910
I'm sorry.

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:27.100
No...

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:32.300
I get it. I won't worry about your matters anymore.

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:34.950
Huh? What's going on?

00:10:36.140 --> 00:10:38.450
You're going too far!

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:42.060
Yui, why?

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:45.860
You wouldn't understand, Hanabi!

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:53.920
What do you mean?

00:10:57.360 --> 00:11:00.790
Is it because I'm just a child?

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:07.320
That's enough!

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:20.710
Sure, I'm not mature like Yui. My breasts are flat, too.

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:22.350
I haven't had my period yet, too.

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:24.590
But even so...

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:28.160
You're an idiot, Yui.

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:51.450
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:58.520
I had a fight with my friend Yui.

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:03.320
Hey, are you wearing different shoes on purpose?

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:08.350
What's going on here!?

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:10.860
So you did mess up!

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:13.550
I thought it was some new fashion.

00:12:13.860 --> 00:12:15.690
Normally it would have been...

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:18.680
Hanabi, what's with those shoes?

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:20.660
Come on, get them changed.

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:23.850
Yui would have told me about it.

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:36.300
Hey.

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:46.900
Don't you think something's wrong between Ayase and Aoi?

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:49.690
Yeah, it seems like they're fighting.

00:12:49.690 --> 00:12:51.190
Fighting?

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:54.010
You sure we can just ignore it?

00:12:55.470 --> 00:13:00.200
It's between the girls themselves. I feel bad if I interrupt as a boyfriend.

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:04.960
That's the mature way to look at it, I guess.

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:11.660
But you sure you can just ignore it when your girlfriend is all sad?

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:23.390
What? Sorry I'm so childish.

00:13:23.390 --> 00:13:25.430
You're right, Hiyama.

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:26.480
Thanks.

00:13:27.980 --> 00:13:32.460
I can't just ignore her like this. It's not manly.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:39.880
Hey, I know Yui was wrong,

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:42.360
but shouldn't you two make up already?

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:44.470
I wasn't wrong.

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:46.200
Hanabi.

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:48.950
I won't apologize, ever.

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.580
Ayase.

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:56.090
Can we talk after school?

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:05.100
Hiyama!

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:07.520
Did you fight with Ayase?

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:09.460
It's all my fault.

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:13.260
I didn't understand how Hanabi felt.

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:15.810
Then why don't you just ask her?

00:14:15.810 --> 00:14:20.030
But if she gets mad again...

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:23.630
I don't really understand the world of girls.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:28.600
But Ayase isn't someone who would just ignore you when she's mad.

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:30.090
Hiyama.

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.360
Go talk to her.

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:42.030
You still look down.

00:14:42.030 --> 00:14:45.530
I didn't talk to Yui at all today.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.930
Do you want this to keep going?

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:51.000
I'm so lonely.

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:58.930
But Yui told me that I wouldn't understand.

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:00.900
That really hurt me.

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:07.360
I admire Yui so much.

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:13.000
She can do anything, just like a big sister.

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:18.850
I'm sure she doesn't want to be friends with someone who thinks like me.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:20.960
Did she tell you that herself?

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:23.580
No.

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:27.420
I like you too when you're with Aoi.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:28.680
Huh?

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:32.110
You're always laughing and smiling.

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:39.110
Aoi's the same. She smiles naturally when she's with you.

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:40.950
Yui, too?

00:15:40.950 --> 00:15:48.090
I don't think it has anything to do with how well you study or how mature you are.

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:51.930
You're friends because you can smile and laugh together, right?

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:05.870
I became friends with Yui when I first became a 5th grader.

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:16.140
I wanted to make a lot of friends, but I took a lot of days off due to a cold.

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:17.770
Nice to meet you!

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:19.130
Me too!

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:25.010
The girls have split into their own groups already!

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:28.480
Please form pairs and draw portraits of each other.

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:31.470
If there's someone extra he or she can pair up with me.

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:32.970
No!

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:38.580
How can I make friends?

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:48.030
Want to pair up with me?

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:54.390
I'm Aoi Yui.

00:16:57.010 --> 00:16:59.760
I'm Ayase Hanabi!

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:06.800
Yui talked to me when I was feeling the most worried.

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:08.940
I was really happy!

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:14.960
Yui...

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:18.670
Aoi just left.

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:28.830
Yui is so kind...

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:34.170
Being with her makes me so happy.

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:37.770
Yui is...

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.900
I'm done!

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:41.990
I'm done, too.

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:44.680
Yui, you're so good!

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:48.040
Doesn't look like her at all!

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:51.540
Hey! Stop it!

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.240
Give it back!

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:55.490
Give it back already!

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:57.530
Give it back!

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:00.250
You fool!

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:06.610
Yui!

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:10.580
Were you about to hit a girl!?

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:14.560
I won't forgive you if you hit my friend!

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:21.020
She said she was my friend then.

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:23.100
I was so happy.

00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:26.020
Ow...

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:29.320
Wait right there, Aoi.

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:35.570
Yui and girls from another school?

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:40.710
Don't ignore us.

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:42.270
Yui!

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:44.580
Hanabi!

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:46.150
Who are you?

00:18:46.150 --> 00:18:48.560
I'm her friend!

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:53.290
Or used to be... It's a bit complicated now.

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:54.650
Huh!?

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:59.650
We're in her same piano class.

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:03.520
Yui said she stopped going because she wanted to study more...

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:06.510
What? That was it?

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:07.740
What a lie.

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:11.170
She stopped coming because she got left out of our group.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:16.680
It was so annoying being with you.

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:19.370
You kept getting into our business, acting all mature.

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:22.460
You must feel the same way, right?

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:24.500
Is that right, Yui?

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:34.770
Yes, I didn't quit because I wanted to study more.

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:39.800
I hated the fact that they kept telling me that I was a worrywart.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:41.470
I ran away.

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:46.360
So that's why when I told her the same thing...

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:48.160
You're so annoying.

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:52.070
You should stop being her friend, too.

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:54.620
Mind your own business.

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:56.730
Right?

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:59.040
I mean you three!

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:01.360
I can decide who I want to be my friend!

00:20:02.140 --> 00:20:07.950
She may be a worrywart sometimes, but that's because she likes me!

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:11.660
It's completely different from you three bullies!

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:15.190
Ayase!

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:24.100
Who is that handsome guy?

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:26.380
Oh no! I didn't dress up today!

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:27.740
We're going home!

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.550
Ow...

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:34.570
Are you okay?

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:35.120
Ayase!

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:38.520
I'm fine!

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:41.440
I wanted to save Yui, that's why.

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:45.790
I'm so sorry I lied and said those terrible things!

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:52.290
I'm a worrywart and I can't be honest like you.

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:54.500
Yui.

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:58.710
There are so many things about you that I admire.

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:03.440
I hated myself for who I am.

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:07.320
Yui was thinking the same thing as me?

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:10.000
Even so, can you be my friend?

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:11.530
Of course!

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:13.810
We're best friends forever!

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:17.380
Because I love you, Yui!

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:21.430
I love you too, Hanabi!

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:29.720
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:34.140
We fought, cried, and made up.

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:37.340
Did we become a little bit more mature?

00:23:12.840 --> 00:23:15.360
I'm sorry that you had to walk me home.

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:18.050
That's fine. I wanted to do so anyway.

00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:20.830
It's great that you made up with her.

00:23:21.170 --> 00:23:23.420
Sorry for worrying you.

00:23:23.420 --> 00:23:25.150
You should let me worry.

00:23:25.760 --> 00:23:27.970
I am your boyfriend, after all.

00:23:30.520 --> 00:23:32.800
It's almost Tanabata.

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:36.130
Yeah, we should see the Milky Way together.

00:23:36.130 --> 00:23:36.880
Yep!

00:23:41.230 --> 00:23:43.090
